# Keep development-only files out of the public deployment.
# The site is served from the repo root (outputDirectory "."), so anything left
# here would otherwise be downloadable, e.g. /supabase/page_content.sql or the
# Starter Guide source in docs/. None of these are needed by the live site.
# NOTE: scripts/ must stay — Vercel runs `npm run build` (scripts/build-static.js).
docs/
supabase/
.github/
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
